  "Set up automatically: the engine ships inside this app's installer and is extracted on first launch, then kept current from GitHub. Only change this to use your own build (the folder containing setup_windows.bat).": "Se configura automáticamente: el motor viene dentro del instalador de esta app, se extrae en el primer arranque y luego se mantiene al día desde GitHub. Cámbialo solo para usar tu propia build (la carpeta que contiene setup_windows.bat).",
